[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0010","text":"卷心菜、青椒、茄子……嗯！\n需要的蔬菜都切好了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0020","text":"接下来……\n该准备肉了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0030","text":"肚子，饿了……\n小奈，有没有什么吃的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0040","text":"……不在……？\n甜花，等不了BBQ……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0050","text":"蔬菜，就一点点……\n生吃也没问题的，那种……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0060","text":"……──！\n啊、啊呜……好辣……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0070","text":"──啊！偷吃了！？\n不行哦～，甜花酱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0080","text":"小奈，水……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0090","text":"洋葱生吃可不好吃哦～？\n我马上去倒水，等一下哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_04_0100","text":"谢谢……"}]
